  "summaries": [
    {
      "id": 4775,
      "category": "team",
      "content": "On May 2nd, 2017 @apapedulimu reported an issue where changing a POST request to a GET request on one of our integration servers returned a full error stack trace rather than an HTTP 404 error. The full error stack trace revealed the full path of the Node.js modules directory on the integration server. We deployed a fix to this issue whereby an HTTP 404 was returned instead.",
